<programme start="20261116123000 +0000" stop="20261116153000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at Virginia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Virginia Tech Hokies (6-3, 3-3 ACC) host the Stanford Cardinal (4-5, 2-4 ACC) at Lane Stadium. Quarterback Davis Warren leads Stanford with 14 touchdowns, while quarterback Ethan Grunkemeyer leads Virginia Tech with 18 touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261116153000 +0000" stop="20261116183000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Wake Forest at SMU</sub-title><desc lang="en">The SMU Mustangs (7-2, 5-2 ACC) host the No. 13 Wake Forest Demon Deacons (8-1, 5-1 ACC) at Gerald J. Ford Stadium in Dallas. Wake Forest aims for a seven-game win streak behind Gio Lopez, while SMU recently defeated Virginia Tech, 51-28.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
