<programme start="20261116033800 +0000" stop="20261116053500 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Night of the Hunted</title><sub-title lang="es">Night of the Hunted</sub-title><desc lang="es">When Alice stops at a remote gas station at night, she&apos;s made the plaything of a crazy sniper with a secret vendetta. To survive, she must figure out who wants her dead.</desc><credits><director>Franck Khalfoun</director><actor>Camille Rowe</actor><actor>J Bieler</actor><actor>Aleksandar Popovic</actor><actor>Jeremy Scippio</actor><actor>Monaia Abdelrahim</actor><actor>Abbe Andersen</actor><actor>Brian Breiter</actor><actor>Brenda Nunez</actor></credits><date>19010101</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/5042a3d830879f5f7c6ee6e3261946cd.jpeg"/></programme>
