<programme start="20261116111700 +0000" stop="20261116134400 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">The Stanford Prison Experiment</title><sub-title lang="es">The Stanford Prison Experiment</sub-title><desc lang="es">In 1971, Stanford&apos;s Professor Philip Zimbardo (Billy Crudup) conducts a controversial psychology experiment in which college students pretend to be either prisoners or guards, but the proceedings soon get out of hand.</desc><credits><director>Kyle Alvarez</director><actor>Billy Crudup</actor><actor>Michael Angarano</actor><actor>Moises Arias</actor><actor>Nicholas Braun</actor><actor>Gaius Charles</actor><actor>Keir Gilchrist</actor><actor>Lee Ki-hong</actor><actor>Thomas Mann</actor><actor>Ezra Miller</actor><actor>Logan Miller</actor><actor>Tye Sheridan</actor><actor>Nelsan Ellis</actor><actor>Olivia Thirlby</actor><actor>Chris Sheffield</actor></credits><date>20150717</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_R</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6374141f5e3d346fcb19a0a991724a3c.jpeg"/></programme>
