<programme start="20261117034000 +0000" stop="20261117042400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">A Discovery of Witches</title><desc lang="en">Gillian pays a price for her disloyalty to Diana; the vampires study witch DNA; the fall-out threatens the fragile equilibrium between creatures and the focus is on ending Matthew and Diana&apos;s relationship, whatever the cost.</desc><credits><actor>Matthew Goode</actor><actor>Teresa Palmer</actor><actor>Alex Kingston</actor></credits><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15990485_e_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
