<programme start="20261116080900 +0000" stop="20261116082000 +0000" channel="Cartoonito 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">Hey Fuzzy Yellow</title><sub-title lang="es">Jungle Feet Deliver</sub-title><desc lang="es">Fuzzy Yellow y Patoto le entregan un par de calcetines tejidos nuevos a Bennu, quien se encuentra en medio de una rápida aventura en la jungla.</desc><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Series/Children</category><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/Action</category><category lang="es">Children/Series</category><category lang="es">Culture/Knowledge</category><category lang="es">Children</category><category lang="es">Series/Animated</category><category lang="es">Culture</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.30.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E31</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/235/17141235-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
