<programme start="20261117010000 +0000" stop="20261117020000 +0000" channel="Fox Business"><title lang="en">How America Works</title><sub-title lang="en">Fish</sub-title><desc lang="en">The men and women aboard a massive fishing boat toil 24/7 to harvest America&apos;s sustenance from the sea, but after coming up short on their last trip, the pressure is on to fill their quota.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20674142_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261117020000 +0000" stop="20261117030000 +0000" channel="Fox Business"><title lang="en">How America Works</title><sub-title lang="en">Salt</sub-title><desc lang="en">Salt workers brave a barren landscape in Carlsbad, N.M., to bring this important mineral to the American public; with a cold front sweeping the northern states, and icy roads in need of salt, they&apos;re racing to send off as much product as possible.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20674142_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
