<programme start="20261117040000 +0000" stop="20261117050000 +0000" channel="Fox Business"><title lang="en">How America Works</title><sub-title lang="en">Corn</sub-title><desc lang="en">Corn growers and millers labor year-round to bring America&apos;s top crop to the masses; with Super Bowl Sunday fast approaching -- the peak day for corn consumption -- mills like Lifeline Foods race to process 1 million pounds of product per day.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20674142_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
