<programme start="20261116085500 +0000" stop="20261116095700 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Magic Circle of the Reef</title><sub-title lang="en">Little Giants: The Benthonics</sub-title><desc lang="en">The ability of the Coral Triangle reef to adapt to climate change has alerted the scientific community, discovering that the main culprits are living beings of all sizes that live attached to the seabed, the so-called Benthonic.</desc><date>20231019</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c82bbbc1c859dd3cef5c2a2fe9a7aa3d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261116095700 +0000" stop="20261116110000 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Magic Circle of the Reef</title><sub-title lang="en">The Pelagics: Eat and Swim</sub-title><desc lang="en">Pelagic beings live in the so-called reef water column, the zone between the seabed and the surface; they are species that travel the sea placidly, feeding when they are hungry and swimming slowly throughout their lives.</desc><credits><actor>Percy Hoven</actor></credits><date>20231026</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c82bbbc1c859dd3cef5c2a2fe9a7aa3d.jpeg"/></programme>
