<programme start="20261116125900 +0000" stop="20261116135700 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Galapagos</title><sub-title lang="en">The New Beginning</sub-title><desc lang="en">Experience the wonders of animal life in the Galápagos, where volcanoes, ocean currents and isolation shape existence; dive into mangrove forests, meet bold boobies and flightless cormorants; see Darwin&apos;s theory of evolution in action.</desc><date>20250603</date><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6b4d0724935af78caa2c7b71913cf396.jpeg"/></programme>
